<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-18T01:17:04.847Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:17:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones have struck a market in Nyala, killing at least 30 civilians, and have also attacked an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan. The Sudanese army says it killed dozens of RSF fighters in a separate Nyala attack, while UN officials are urging an immediate halt to drone strikes and greater pressure to end the war. Sudan’s leader Burhan sent a message to the German chancellor urging peace efforts, and the country has invited the African Human Rights Commission while warning against continued RSF support. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1DdVo0cVRncXRWb0Q0Y3dvM0QxZEtFZGd4eFQwRUQwTllWZDBjZ0FYMkpHdGNKNUw3ZnZkRnoxOFVZUWdFU3N2T0JpOWV4TUpKVE5RVDFRWnlEZ9IBX0FVX3lxTE84YkRGMTBGYkdwNmszTGJnMURCN1pCZTJOWHYyTGFVQ21JbHdyQnVSUE5OMS1ySHJMSTJlYmhnaFFQV2xDcXNiNE9SUndNUDZuRk01TXRQaURHRmVET2pJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1wYzRmVEpmMlgtTlhBWjBvT3JjRFdOaWVXVjQ2RVo5eW5JOTBRZHFnMHZ4ck9HcXlnelpCWmNhTWRFZy1GUTg3ZF9vc0xSb242?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1LajNTaDAzT09MWk1FVk82cV9lb1k2bUNKT2pyV1ZKVC15TlMxYlVmS0huVVpyRXNYLWtTRnd1MHo5UktaQ1hib1A2aklOcDVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPTXdncDl5NXZuVXFWcVRQRUo4UmVwR09ER3RfMUZNclNONkI2akNGazJFN01IMjQxQzljZTBpOE9aalN2eXhhYUVMMmJLdEVzcTVla0tNeDNvZ0RqSE01bUM4VkJFRjdlNk1zUGhfRzdpRlNYMUlVU1pjakZVZzNIVWVfbHgtMVY1S1VRMVd3SjBrYVNrNmVfRE9CNzlCcEtuMzJsenFfZ2dubGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQaXVZbF